  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this initiative supports management of the volunteers program including policy development, implementation, program monitoring and evaluation, program implementation, new program development and design and public diplomacy. Funding also supports the incorporation of disability inclusion, Indigenous inclusion and child protection education packages. The total value of this initiative is approximately $0.8 million over five years, starting 2011-12.</narrative>
